. Furthermore, the reading &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;DINGIR&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;-LIM&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-ni&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; is more compatible with the sign traces, visible on the photograph, which are not accurately reflected in the handcopy."/></w> <w trans="paiš" mrp0sel=" 2" mrp2="pai-/pe-/piya-@geben@3SG.PST@II.6.2@"><del_in/>pa-iš<del_fin/></w> 
